Force Tags                          CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM
...   PY36
...                                 CLOUD_5GC_dRNIC_1vDU_O_AP_LO_SANSA_FS_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD     vDUCNF00    vDUCNF23R1
